{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:5227-1","published":"2026-11-12T19:56:31Z","modified":"2026-11-13T12:00:03.986004368Z","related":["CVE-2026-97033","CVE-2026-97034","CVE-2026-97035","CVE-2026-97036","CVE-2026-97037","CVE-2026-97038","CVE-2026-97039","CVE-2026-97040","CVE-2026-97041","CVE-2026-97042","CVE-2026-97043","CVE-2026-97054"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-97033","CVE-2026-97034","CVE-2026-97035","CVE-2026-97036","CVE-2026-97037","CVE-2026-97038","CVE-2026-97039","CVE-2026-97040","CVE-2026-97041","CVE-2026-97042","CVE-2026-97043","CVE-2026-97054"],"summary":"Security update for go1.26","details":"This update for go1.26 fixes the following issue:\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-97033: `cmd/go`: unexpected code execution via `--sysroot`, `-target`, `-isysroot`, `-Wl,-syslibroot`, and\n  `-x cgo` flags (bsc#1289978).\n- CVE-2026-97034: `cmd/go`: arbitrary command execution via GCC spec files in `cgo` linker search directories\n  (bsc#1289979).\n- CVE-2026-97035: `cmd/go`: unexpected code execution and arbitrary file write via Clang `-gen-*` and GCC `-gnat*`\n  flags in `cgo` (bsc#1289980).\n- CVE-2026-97036: `cmd/go`: arbitrary code execution during build on darwin via `-l to_library` in `cgo` (bsc#1289981).\n- CVE-2026-97037: `cmd/go`: linker script injection via split `-Wl,` flags and Darwin or symbol linker flags in `cgo`\n  (bsc#1289982).\n- CVE-2026-97038: `cmd/go`: arbitrary code execution via crafted `.syso` files and `cgo` linker input files\n  (bsc#1289983).\n- CVE-2026-97039: `cmd/go`: flag sanitization bypass via `#cgo pkg-config:` directives (bsc#1289984).\n- CVE-2026-97040: `cmd/go`, `cmd/link`: `cgo` directive injection via `.syso` files disguised as Go object files\n  (bsc#1289985).\n- CVE-2026-97041: `cmd/compile`, `cmd/link`: host linker flag injection via `//go:cgo_*` directives (bsc#1289986).\n- CVE-2026-97042: `cmd/cgo`, `cmd/compile`, `cmd/link`: linker flag injection via `cgo_import_dynamic` and PE DLL\n  names (bsc#1289987).\n- CVE-2026-97043: `cmd/go`, `cmd/compile`: unexpected code execution via escaped quotes in `//go:cgo_ldflag`\n  (bsc#1289988).\n- CVE-2026-97054: `net/http`: HTTP/1 server crash due to `MaxBytesReader` header race (bsc#1289989).\n\nChanges for go1.26:\n\nUpdate to version go1.26.11 (bsc#1255111):\n\n- go#81865 `cmd/compile`: `branchelim` optimization can eliminate result of store\n- go#81869 `cmd/compile`: generic shift-by-constant canonicalization gives `Const64` the wrong type\n- go#81926 `cmd/asm`: amd64 assembler loops forever on a forward jump to a labelled `PCALIGN` when a branch needs\n  widening\n- go#81946 `net/http`: backport fix to protect against middleware changing server response body\n- go#82022 `net`: `Dialer.Dial{TCP,UDP,IP}` incorrectly treats invalid addresses as `::`\n- go#82149 `runtime`: linux/mips `time64` nanosecond layout causes busy waits and empty CPU profiles\n- go#82333 `cmd/dist`: `GOFIPS140` bootstrap from Go 1.26 fails\n- go#82626 `crypto/fips140`: minor compliance improvements\n- go#82642 `cmd/compile`: ICE on 386 when inlining nested bit rotations (`Int64Lo` not lowered)\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"go1.26","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Module for Development Tools 15 SP7","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/go1.26&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Module%20for%20Development%20Tools%2015%20SP7"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.26.11-150000.1.39.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"go1.26":"1.26.11-150000.1.39.1","go1.26-doc":"1.26.11-150000.1.39.1","go1.26-race":"1.26.11-150000.1.39.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5227-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"go1.26","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise High Performance Computing 15 SP4-ESPOS","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/go1.26&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20High%20Performance%20Computing%2015%20SP4-ESPOS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.26.11-150000.1.39